Before placing a high-risk AI system on the market, importers shall ensure conformity by verifying that:
(a) the relevant conformity assessment procedure has been carried out by the provider;
(b) the provider has drawn up the technical documentation;
(c) the system bears the required CE marking, EU declaration of conformity, and instructions for use; and
(d) the provider has appointed an authorised representative [Article 23].
